      "title": "Missing lock in TokenBucket initialization",
      "file": "limiter.py",
      "severity": "medium",
      "detail": "The patch adds `self._lock = threading.Lock()` in `__init__`, but the `allow` method (which accesses and modifies `self.tokens` and `self.updated`) does not acquire this lock. This renders the lock useless and leaves the token bucket vulnerable to race conditions in multi-threaded environments."
    }
